-- Restore the RL3 room name.
-- Addressed by the name apply left behind, not the one being restored: at this
-- point the FRMW is still called /1RX-CODEX-NOROOM. If apply did not run, this
-- macro finds nothing — which is the correct outcome, there is nothing to undo.
ALPHA LOG "D:/work/plant-code/old/gen-model/scripts/e3d/room_name_out_restore.log" OVER
/1RX-CODEX-NOROOM
Q CE
NAME /1RX-RM05-R512
Q NAME
SAVEWORK 'CODEX room RL3: restore room name'
ALPHA LOG END
